"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521820011:1":{"text":"이건...?","source_cn":"这是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x456E41E096E54C6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:15::2":{"text":"망가진 장갑","source_cn":"破旧的手甲","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE44F683ABFC45AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521820012:0":{"text":"소트의... 갑옷. 페르세우스가 가져다주었지...","source_cn":"索特的……盔甲。珀尔修斯……带回来它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB51EB3A5D567B2EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521820013:1":{"text":"소트는 할머니의 가족인가요? 군대에 들어갔다던 그 손자요?","source_cn":"索特是您的家人？您那位加入军队的孙子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF113B5799075E7CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521820014:0":{"text":"소트... 그래.","source_cn":"索特……对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89930D0800582CDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521820015:1":{"text":"그럼 가져갈 수 없어요.","source_cn":"那我不能带走它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35924EE6FC8B0B61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521820016:1":{"text":"페르세우스는 소트를 잃은 할머니를 위로하기 위해 이 장갑을 가져온 거예요. 이건 가져갈 수 없어요.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯将这副手甲带回来，是想给您留作纪念，缓解您失去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD700D0CFA67B27D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521820017:0":{"text":"괜찮아요, 할머니. 페르세우스가 남긴 물건이 없다면 억지로 찾지 않으셔도 돼요. 다른 곳에서 찾아볼게요.","source_cn":"没关系，婆婆。珀尔修斯没有留下东西的话也不用勉强，我还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35000AF3A58BBD8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521820018:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521820019:0":{"text":"에누르는 잠시 조용히 있다가, 집 안에서 깔끔하게 정리된 옷가지를 가져왔다.","source_cn":"艾努尔沉默了一会儿，又从屋内拿出了一套整洁的衣服。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22291FC78E1645F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521820020:0":{"text":"내가 만든, 옷...","source_cn":"我做的，衣服……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AE03E0F71F17A9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_reco